  m_text: '<size=48><b>How to Play:</b></size>\n\n<size=32><line-height=150%>1. Follow
    the Flight Plan: The magenta line on the Navigation Display guides you towards
    your destination.\n2. Maintain Target Speed and Altitude: Use the autopilot or
    manual controls to keep your airspeed and altitude aligned with the magenta triangles
    on the PFD.\n3. Intercept the ILS: As you get closer to the airport, you will
    be instructed to intercept the localizer and glideslope. Follow the guidance
    provided by the horizontal and vertical bars on the PFD to align with the runway.\n4.
    Monitor Your Instruments: Pay close attention to all the information on your
    displays to ensure a stable and safe approach.\n5. Prepare for Landing: As you
    descend, you will need to manage your speed and configuration for a smooth touchdown.</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
